| !JsEdit mode: BBC BASIC V listings (BASIC files, &FFB, are detokenised on loading and tokenised on saving)
| The keywords come from BBC BASIC's own tables; add any others with Keywords.
Name       BASIC
Lexer      basic
Types      &FFB
Indent     2
Comment    REM
Functions  ^\s*\d*\s*DEF\s*((?:PROC|FN)[\w`]+)
Colour     lineno 5
Colour     keyword 8 bold
Colour     string 13
Colour     number 11
Colour     comment 4
Colour     api 14
Colour     command 15
Colour     variable 7
Colour     punct 7
